  "releaseNotes": "## [2.4.2] - 2026-10-28\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Evolve2 devices are not currently supported by the SDK over Bluetooth LE. \n  Some Evolve2 devices could delay the initial Bluetooth LE scan, so they are now explicitly ignored during Bluetooth LE device enumeration.\n\n- An issue where certain devices with a big HID report could cause device discovery to fail.\n\n- An issue where call lock requests for non-USB devices could cause the Device Connector to crash.",
